@MyWestLord @uwunetes @0xAikoDai fed Fable 5 an old roguelike and it turned the whole thing 3D in 10 minutes.

Better animations, audio, bosses, hybrid rendering.

The upgrade from previous models is obvious and immediate. Game dev just got turbocharged.

@MyWestLord had Fable 5 rebuild GTA VI in 10 hours. 

4 million tokens, no team, no billion-dollar budget. It even cut a trailer.

Bro, the wall between you and AAA just became a prompt. Wild how fast intent turns into playable chaos.
